And the live GitHub Pages web app:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class="crayons-card c-embed text-styles text-styles--secondary"&gt;
&lt;div class="c-embed__content"&gt;
&lt;div class="c-embed__body flex items-center justify-between"&gt;
&lt;a href="https://joelezema.github.io/phokus-notepad/" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="c-link fw-bold flex items-center"&gt;
&lt;span class="mr-2"&gt;joelezema.github.io&lt;/span&gt;


